Before writing or editing code, read the agent guides in this order:

1. `AGENTS.md` (repo root) — GitNexus workflow (impact analysis, query, detect_changes) and pointer to the project guide.
2. `agent/AGENTS.md` — chat-socket-fe project structure, data flow, "where do I put X?" lookup, and map of rules / plans / skills.

For a specific task, follow the matching files under `agent/rules/`, `agent/plans/`, and `agent/skills/` as listed in `agent/AGENTS.md` §3–§4.

Do not assume file paths or stack conventions from memory — verify against `agent/AGENTS.md` and the relevant rule files first.
